apps/cli/editor-dist/
*.tgz

# Screen-recording MASTERS (R22 §108). The derived, shipped assets live in
# `docs/site/assets/` — one copy, served by Pages and linked from the README.
# The multi-MB source recordings stay out: they are re-recorded every time the
# UI changes, and git would keep every generation of them forever.
docs/assets/

# Working drafts that are nobody else's business: launch copy, post scripts,
# evaluation notes, anything half-thought. Ignored as a DIRECTORY so a new
# draft needs no new rule — the reason `docs/assets/` had started collecting
# markdown that has nothing to do with screen recordings.
# Nothing here is published, reviewed, or a decision. A draft that becomes a
# decision moves to `docs/superpowers/plans/` or the findings log and gets
# committed like anything else.
docs/local/
apps/cli/.posthog-events.json
apps/cli/.claude/

# Verification run artifacts — regenerated per run, see .claude/skills/verify-ossclip
docs/verification/
